#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:5
#: 61fbc327e7c243fa9fc99d40aa1cf7fc
msgid "Copter Mission Command List"
msgstr "ArduCopter任务指令列表"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:7
#: caa01f638b1d4924b24e45b53e70b7ff
msgid ""
"This page provides details of all the mission commands (i.e. `MAVLink "
"commands "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT>`__) "
"supported by Copter that can be run as part of a mission (see :ref:`AUTO "
"flight mode <auto-mode>`)."
msgstr ""
"本页详细介绍了ArduCopter支持的所有任务指令（即 `MAVLink指令 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT>`__），这些指令可作为任务的一部分运行（参见"
" :ref:`Auto飞行模式 <auto-mode>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:10
#: 7a43970d80364f0cbd9552a08e415eb6
msgid ""
"Each of the commands below is either a \"Navigation\" command or a \"Do\" "
"command.  Navigation commands (e.g. \"TakeOff\" and \"Waypoint\") affect the"
" location of the vehicle while \"Do\" commands (e.g. \"Do-Set-Servo\" and "
"\"Do-Cam-Trigg-Dist\") are for auxiliary functions and do not affect the "
"vehicle's position."
msgstr ""
"以下每条指令均为\"导航\"指令或\"执行\"指令。导航指令（例如\"TakeOff\"和\"Waypoint\"）影响飞行器位置，而\"执行\"指令（例如\"Do-"
"Set-Servo\"和\"Do-Cam-Trigg-Dist\"）用于辅助功能，不影响飞行器位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:14
#: c9d5cb04810a44099b324aba521534ef
msgid ""
"During a mission at most one \"Navigation\" command and one \"Do\" command "
"can be running at one time.  The \"Do\" commands will be run in order as "
"soon as the preceding navigation command before them completes.  For more "
"information on setting up missions please refer to the :ref:`Planning a "
"Mission with Waypoints and Events <common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-"
"and-events>` page."
msgstr ""
"任务执行期间，同一时刻最多只能运行一条\"导航\"指令和一条\"执行\"指令。\"执行\"指令将在其前面的导航指令完成后按顺序立即执行。有关设置任务的更多信息，请参阅"
" :ref:`规划带航点和事件的任务 <common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events>` "
"页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:19
#: 2727234a8465435e9d990e87b575c32d
msgid "Takeoff"
msgstr "起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:24
#: b596ec0f3db548f89b92454b0882d083
msgid ""
"The vehicle will climb straight up from its current location to the altitude"
" specified (in meters). This should be the first command of nearly all "
"missions."
msgstr "飞行器将从当前位置垂直爬升至指定高度（单位：米）。这应该是几乎所有任务的第一条指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:28
#: b025ff51dc31413db9f9774a1d5e63e6
msgid ""
"If the mission is begun while the copter is already flying, the vehicle will"
" climb straight up to the specified altitude, if the vehicle is already "
"above the specified altitude the takeoff command will be ignored and the "
"mission will move onto the next command immediately.  In this case any "
"\"DO\" commands immediately following the TAKEOFF will also be ignored."
msgstr ""
"如果飞机已在飞行状态时任务启动，飞行器将垂直爬升至指定高度；如果飞行器已在指定高度以上，则起飞指令将被忽略，任务将立即移至下一条指令。在这种情况下，紧跟TAKEOFF指令之后的所有\"DO\"指令也将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:35
#: 50c8dde482264ed5af1123222f99feaa
msgid "Waypoint"
msgstr "航点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:40
#: e9dccc2f923e4d5d99fbc0b8fce01f1c
msgid ""
"The vehicle will fly a straight line to the location specified as a lat, lon"
" and altitude (in meters)."
msgstr "飞行器将沿直线飞往以纬度、经度和高度（单位：米）指定的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:43
#: 9f620b9eef49492b9a77c596374cf639
msgid ""
"**Delay** - the amount of time to wait (in seconds) at the waypoint before "
"proceeding to the next command"
msgstr "**Delay** - 在该航点等待的时间（秒），然后继续执行下一条指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:46
#: 450d1caa9ca241fc979a5661f9b6aeec
msgid ""
"**Hit Rad** - not supported - meant to hold the distance (in meters) from "
"the target point that will qualify the waypoint as complete. This command is"
" not supported. Instead, the :ref:`WP_RADIUS_M<WP_RADIUS_M>` parameter "
"should be used (see \"WP Radius\" field in the above screenshot or adjust "
"through the Standard Parameters List).  Even the "
":ref:`WP_RADIUS_M<WP_RADIUS_M>` is only used when the waypoint has a Delay. "
"With no delay specified the waypoint will be considered complete when the "
"virtual point that the vehicle is chasing reaches the waypoint. This can be "
"10m (or more) ahead of the vehicle meaning that the vehicle will turn "
"towards the following waypoint long before it actually reaches the current "
"waypoint"
msgstr ""
"**Hit Rad** - 不支持 - 原本用于设定到目标点的距离（单位 米），在此范围内视为航点完成。此命令不受支持，应改用 "
":ref:`WP_RADIUS_M<WP_RADIUS_M>` 参数（见上方截图中的 \"WP Radius\" 字段，或通过标准参数列表调整）。即便是"
" :ref:`WP_RADIUS_M<WP_RADIUS_M>` "
"也仅在航点有延迟时才使用。若未指定延迟，则当飞行器追踪的虚拟点到达航点时即视为完成。该虚拟点可能比飞行器实际位置超前 "
"10m（或更多），这意味着飞行器会在实际到达当前航点之前很早就转向下一个航点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:57
#: e42e83d3b5af45c4a91eee52dca30686
msgid ""
"**Yaw Ang** - not supported - meant to hold the resulting yaw angle in "
"degrees (0=north, 90 = east). Instead use a :ref:`CONDITION_YAW <mission-"
"command-list_condition-yaw>` command."
msgstr ""
"**Yaw Ang** - 不支持——原本用于设置最终偏航角（0=北，90=东）。请改用 :ref:`CONDITION_YAW <mission-"
"command-list_condition-yaw>` 指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:61
#: a758a326f2474b92bb66ed256fa66df3
msgid ""
"**Lat, Lon** - the latitude and longitude targets.  If left as zero, current"
" location will be substituted for waypoint location, making it appear as if "
"the waypoint is simply skipped."
msgstr "**Lat, Lon** - 目标纬度和经度。若保留为零，将以当前位置替代航点位置，效果相当于跳过该航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:63
#: 081f015ab4d140faaa76c2571598f2ae
msgid ""
"**Alt** - the target altitude above home in meters.  If left as zero it will"
" hold the current altitude."
msgstr "**Alt** - 相对Home点的目标高度（米）。若保留为零，则保持当前高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:67
#: 119c6871af424feeb98508f841f8ded2
msgid "Spline Waypoint"
msgstr "样条航点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:72
#: 43408c9090f94a4e90f2976ec49ab83e
msgid ""
"`Spline <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spline_%28mathematics%29>`__ "
"waypoints take all the same arguments as regular waypoints (lat, lon, alt, "
"delay) but when executed the vehicle will fly smooth paths (both vertically "
"and horizontally) instead of straight lines.  Spline waypoints can be mixed "
"with regular straight line waypoints as shown in the image above."
msgstr ""
"`样条 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spline_%28mathematics%29>`__ "
"航点接受与普通航点相同的所有参数（纬度、经度、高度、延迟），但执行时飞行器将沿平滑路径飞行（水平和垂直方向均平滑），而不是直线。样条航点可与普通直线航点混合使用，如上图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:74
#: c1948da2a6a94d9ba90f72f3533e2773
msgid ""
"The Mission Planner shows the path the vehicle will take.  The image above "
"shows some characteristics of the spline"
msgstr "Mission Planner显示了飞行器将飞行的路径。上图展示了样条的一些特性："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:77
#: 4230d3e4503149768346b774f4d24874
msgid ""
"The 1 second delay at the end of Waypoint #1 causes the vehicle to stop so "
"Spline command #2 begins by taking a sharp 90degree turn"
msgstr "航点 #1 末尾的 1 秒延迟导致飞行器停止，因此样条指令 #2 从急转 90 度开始"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:79
#: 575f6249b8a2448880a9134ce6c7a98a
msgid ""
"The direction of travel as the vehicle passes through Spline Waypoint #3 is "
"parallel to an imaginary line drawn between waypoints #2 and #4"
msgstr "飞行器经过样条航点 #3 时的飞行方向与航点 #2 和 #4 之间的假想连线平行"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:81
#: b8d79b9dd4cc407883fcc890be4c8ec4
msgid ""
"Waypoint #5 is a straight line so the vehicle lines itself up to point "
"towards waypoint #5 even before reaching waypoint #4."
msgstr "航点 #5 是直线，因此飞行器在到达航点 #4 之前就已经开始朝向航点 #5 方向对齐。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:85
#: 0e3e73bbb3714d92af277dfbf118c55d
msgid "Loiter_Time"
msgstr "Loiter_Time"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:90
#: 687fef68f1104614a04f094ae6497ca2
msgid ""
"The vehicle will fly to and then wait at the specified location for the "
"specified number of seconds.  This is the same as a Waypoint command."
msgstr "飞行器将飞往指定位置并在该位置等待指定秒数。与航点指令相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:93
#: 488845d569eb44d0a50a60fafe360625
msgid "**Times** - the number of seconds to remain at the location."
msgstr "**Times** - 在该位置停留的秒数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:95
#: 44aa898d9c09461ca3199fc8684bf009
msgid ""
"**Lat, Lon** - the latitude and longitude targets. If left as zero it will "
"hold at the current location."
msgstr "**Lat, Lon** - 目标纬度和经度。若保留为零，则在当前位置保持。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:98
#: 00383f3852e04c638df0d9899ab3130f
msgid ""
"**Alt** - the target altitude above home in meters. If left as zero it will "
"hold at the current altitude."
msgstr "**Alt** - 相对Home点的目标高度（米）。若保留为零，则保持当前高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:102
#: 279f550153c14a6c9429d644afdd5214
msgid "Loiter_Turns"
msgstr "Loiter_Turns"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:107
#: 87bee03d75da458298a3a6a35bed9e2c
msgid ""
"The mission equivalent of the :ref:`Circle flight mode <circle-mode>`.  "
"Loiter (circle) the specified location for at least the specified number of "
"complete turns, and then proceed to the next command upon intersection of "
"the course to it with the circle's perimeter. If zero is specified for a "
"latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the current location value for "
"the parameter will be used. Fractional turns between 0 and 1 are supported, "
"while turns greater than 1 must be integers."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Circle飞行模式 <circle-mode>` "
"的任务等效指令。在指定位置绕飞至少指定圈数的完整圈，然后在航线与圆周相交时继续执行下一条指令。如果纬度/经度/高度参数设为零，则使用当前位置值。支持0到1之间的分数圈，大于1的圈数必须为整数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:111
#: 5c209a4bda7946e7829ac1dfec9e4ecd
msgid ""
"The radius of the circle is controlled by the command parameter. A radius of"
" 0 will result in the copter loitering at the location and pirouetting the "
"specified number of turns. Negative radius values result in counter-"
"clockwise turns instead of clockwise turns. Radius values over 255 meters "
"will be rounded down to the nearest 10 meter mark ."
msgstr ""
"圆圈半径由指令参数控制。半径为0时飞机将在指定位置悬停并原地旋转指定圈数。负半径值将产生逆时针转向而非顺时针。超过255米的半径值将向下舍入到最近的10米整数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:114
#: 43717bb2de4d4109950527914560b024
msgid "**Turn** - the number of full rotations to complete around the point."
msgstr "**Turn** - 绕该点完成的完整旋转圈数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:116
#: 809935df830d473f9d46d596fe351d34
msgid ""
"Fractional turns between 0 and 1 are supported, while turns greater than 1 "
"must be integers."
msgstr "支持0到1之间的分数圈，大于1的圈数必须为整数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:118
#: e92d1f2d653a4842bf79a4dcb7aaa365
msgid "**Radius** - Loiter radius around waypoint. Units are in meters."
msgstr "**Radius** - 绕航点的Loiter半径，单位为米。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:120
#: ff376cfde704470da712182a9cd67667
msgid ""
"**Lat, Lon** - the latitude and longitude targets.  If left as zero it will "
"circle around the current location."
msgstr "**Lat, Lon** - 目标纬度和经度。若保留为零，则绕当前位置飞圆。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:123
#: c2e8e216a47d43ee8ee91aba9a081dc5
msgid ""
"**Alt** - the target altitude above home in meters.  If left as zero it will"
" circle at the current altitude."
msgstr "**Alt** - 相对Home点的目标高度（米）。若保留为零，则在当前高度飞圆。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:127
#: 4020c0fb79ed4796a29430a673961836
msgid "Loiter_Unlimited"
msgstr "Loiter_Unlimited"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:132
#: c1ac65a166434d79ac41c53faaad58b4
msgid ""
"The vehicle will fly to and then wait at the specified location "
"indefinitely.  The mission will not proceed past this command."
msgstr "飞行器将飞往指定位置并无限期等待。任务不会继续执行此指令之后的内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:135
#: 29e6aa8668114580a1d6a2698501be29
msgid ""
"**Lat, Lon** - the latitude and longitude targets. If left as zero it will "
"wait at the current location."
msgstr "**Lat, Lon** - 目标纬度和经度。若保留为零，则在当前位置等待。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:138
#: 42a5267f7fd348da97c095637e3bb560
msgid ""
"**Alt** - the target altitude above home in meters. If left as zero it will "
"wait at the current altitude."
msgstr "**Alt** - 相对Home点的目标高度（米）。若保留为零，则在当前高度等待。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:142
#: e619f67c9d0e49079ee237a54fe3a0e1
msgid "Return-To-Launch"
msgstr "返航"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:147
#: 20b1febf749347a5b57dd5a513290608
msgid ""
"Mission equivalent of the :ref:`RTL flight mode <rtl-mode>`.  As described "
"on the RTL flight mode wiki page, the vehicle will first climb to the "
":ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>` parameter's specified altitude (default is 15m) "
"before returning home.  The home location is where the vehicle was last "
"armed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RTL 飞行模式 <rtl-mode>` 的任务等效命令。如 RTL 飞行模式 wiki 页面所述，飞行器将先爬升到 "
":ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>` 参数指定的高度（默认 15m），然后返航。Home 点为飞行器最后一次解锁的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:152
#: 6fa45ef52c134a01a6583f2a9c01ebe6
msgid ""
"This command takes no parameters and generally should be the last command in"
" the mission."
msgstr "此指令不需要任何参数，通常应作为任务的最后一条指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:156
#: 234656d41a4e48379c28deeead531d82
msgid "Land"
msgstr "降落"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:161
#: a56a6aadbbbf467da7b6fdf58b146bfa
msgid ""
"The vehicle will land at its current location or at the lat/lon coordinates "
"provided.  This is the mission equivalent of the :ref:`LAND flight mode "
"<land-mode>`."
msgstr "飞行器将在当前位置或指定纬经度坐标处降落。这是 :ref:`Land飞行模式 <land-mode>` 的任务等效指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:164
#: 69d49641429141759b8c463ba609b4bf
msgid ""
"**Lat, Lon** - the latitude and longitude targets. If left as zero it will "
"land at the current location."
msgstr "**Lat, Lon** - 目标纬度和经度。若保留为零，则在当前位置降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:168
#: 04c5441b53734c618d10b5405054a982
msgid "Delay"
msgstr "延迟"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:173
#: 8ea4e5ca8a6b484596f9b68907504435
msgid ""
"The vehicle will remain at its current location until the specified number "
"of seconds has passed or the absolute time is reached. The first column "
"(\"Seconds\") holds the number of seconds to delay.  Set to -1 if this field"
" should be ignored. The \"hour UTC\", \"minute UTC\" and \"second UTC\" "
"fields can be used to specify an absolute time (`UTC "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coordinated_Universal_Time>`__).  The example"
" above will cause the vehicle to take-off at 1:30pm UTC.  Note that the hour"
" and/or minute field can also be ignored by setting them to -1."
msgstr ""
"飞行器将在当前位置停留，直到指定秒数过去或到达绝对时间。第一列（\"Seconds\"）为延迟秒数，设为-1则忽略此字段。\"hour "
"UTC\"、\"minute UTC\"和\"second UTC\"字段可用于指定绝对时间（`UTC "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coordinated_Universal_Time>`__）。上例将使飞行器在UTC时间下午1:30起飞。注意，小时和/或分钟字段也可以设为-1来忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:177
#: 9afdbf37f05a40a9ba5fec4e496b1c44
msgid ""
"This is a video made during the development of this feature.  Note in the "
"video CONDITION_DELAY command is used but in its final version, this DELAY "
"command should be used."
msgstr "这是此功能开发过程中制作的一段视频。注意视频中使用了CONDITION_DELAY指令，但在最终版本中应使用此DELAY指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:183
#: fb8a9fe2b3cc4d0c88e180e3d9b8dbea
msgid "Payload Place"
msgstr "货物放置"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:188
#: 81924330ce5b46e7814e88db5a7a874d
msgid ""
"The vehicle flies to the specified location and descends until it senses "
"(using motor output) that the package has reached the ground.  The gripper "
"is then released to unload the package and ascend back to the waypoint "
"altitude. The first column (\"Max Desc\") holds the maximum descent (in "
"meters) that the vehicle should descend.  If the package has still not "
"reached the ground despite this descent, the package will not be released "
"and the vehicle will return to  the waypoint altitude and advance to the "
"next mission command. Parameters controlling this operation (besides "
":ref:`Gripper parameters <common-gripper-landingpage>`) are:"
msgstr ""
"飞行器飞往指定位置并下降，直至通过电机输出感知货物已触地。然后释放夹持器以卸下货物，并重新爬升至航点高度。第一列（\"Max "
"Desc\"）为飞行器应下降的最大深度（米）。如果在此下降深度后货物仍未触地，则不会释放货物，飞行器将返回航点高度并继续执行下一条任务指令。控制此操作的参数（除"
" :ref:`夹持器参数 <common-gripper-landingpage>` 外）有："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:192
#: 839c99ef7080448ba5c44d12fae05b88
msgid ""
":ref:`PLDP_SPEED_DN<PLDP_SPEED_DN>`: Descent speed, once the waypoint is "
"reached, is either :ref:`LAND_SPD_MS<LAND_SPD_MS>` or this value, if non-"
"zero."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PLDP_SPEED_DN<PLDP_SPEED_DN>`：到达航点后的下降速度，若此值非零则使用此值，否则使用 "
":ref:`LAND_SPD_MS<LAND_SPD_MS>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:193
#: b50f2511125e490ca2dd01801e05cff3
msgid ""
":ref:`PLDP_THRESH<PLDP_THRESH>`: The percentage of thrust decrease that "
"indicates payload touch-down. The reference thrust is measured over the "
"first two seconds of descent."
msgstr ":ref:`PLDP_THRESH<PLDP_THRESH>`：表示货物触地的推力下降百分比。参考推力在下降开始后的前两秒内测量。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:194
#: 1d57a29d1cf249a9a08056275e69d0c2
msgid ""
":ref:`PLDP_RNG_MAX<PLDP_RNG_MAX>`: If non-zero, the maximum release height "
"over ground obtained from a downward facing rangerfinder. Automatic gripper "
"release can occur only if below this altitude above ground in addition to "
"thrust reduction being obtained. If this value is non zero and no "
"rangefinder is present, the place will be aborted and the vehicle will "
"ascend and proceed to the next waypoint."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PLDP_RNG_MAX<PLDP_RNG_MAX>`：如果不为零，则为从朝下测距仪获取的最大离地释放高度。只有在此离地高度以下且已获得推力减小的情况下，才会自动释放夹持器。如果此值不为零但没有测距仪，则放置操作将中止，飞行器将上升并继续执行下一个航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:195
#: 86f90e54f85f4fc0a99c24d73cc9de4e
msgid ""
":ref:`PLDP_DELAY<PLDP_DELAY>`: Delay in seconds after release the vehicle "
"will remain in position after release before ascending. This allows payload "
"replacement if the gripper is set to re-engage after a delay (see "
":ref:`GRIP_AUTOCLOSE<GRIP_AUTOCLOSE>`)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PLDP_DELAY<PLDP_DELAY>`：释放后飞行器在原位保持的延迟时间（秒），然后再上升。这允许在夹持器设置为延迟后重新啮合时进行货物更换（参见"
" :ref:`GRIP_AUTOCLOSE<GRIP_AUTOCLOSE>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:201
#: 8801347924ae490897fa9b739ec98c7d
msgid "Attitude Time"
msgstr "姿态时间"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:206
#: d9e2c266bd7f4adbac9a4bdfcfff2244
msgid ""
"Vehicle maintains the specified roll, pitch, yaw angle and climb rate for "
"the specified time.  GPS is not required while this command is being "
"executed"
msgstr "飞行器以指定横滚、俯仰、偏航角和爬升率保持指定时间。执行此指令时不需要GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:208
#: 142c99404feb42f29e3fb02baa26a51e
msgid "**Roll**: positive is lean right, negative is lean left"
msgstr "**Roll**：正值为向右倾斜，负值为向左倾斜。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:209
#: b2f1e3811326419b9ff91a93ba1573e1
msgid "**Pitch**: positive is lean back, negative is lean forward"
msgstr "**Pitch**：正值为向后倾斜，负值为向前倾斜。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:210
#: 7cb2410c003a4265abc584d2e8a8a0b4
msgid "**Yaw**: 0 is North, 90 is East, 180 is South, 270 is West"
msgstr "**Yaw**：0为正北，90为正东，180为正南，270为正西。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:211
#: 725f1582ff894d938ee52e70c164f61d
msgid ""
"**ClimbRate**: in m/s but most ground stations incorrectly scale this "
"parameter so it is best to leave at 0m/s"
msgstr "**ClimbRate**：单位m/s，但大多数地面站对此参数的缩放比例不正确，因此最好保留为0m/s。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:217
#: 275988d3e527471aabfec332a0ea47a1
msgid "Script Time"
msgstr "脚本时间"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:222
#: 60f614b51fee4083a452f9ead74245ce
msgid ""
"Lua script runs for the specified time after which it will move onto the "
"next command.  \"command\", \"arg1\" and \"arg2\" arguments are interpreted "
"by the script. The demonstration below used this SCRIPT_TIME command to "
"execute the \"fast descent\" script from within Auto mode."
msgstr ""
"Lua脚本运行指定时间后，将继续执行下一条指令。\"command\"、\"arg1\"和\"arg2\"参数由脚本解释。以下演示使用SCRIPT_TIME指令在Auto模式中执行了\"快速下降\"脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:231
#: dcf3efac48e849be8b852bf88e9f9b4f
msgid "Do-Set-ROI"
msgstr "Do-Set-ROI"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:236
#: fd8dc169eeaf4480b71373995eee4302
msgid ""
"Points the nose of the vehicle or :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-"
"gimbals>` at the \"region of interest\".  In the example above the nose or "
"camera would be pointed at the red marker."
msgstr ""
"将飞行器机头或 :ref:`摄像头云台 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` "
"指向\"兴趣区域\"。在上例中，机头或摄像头将指向红色标记。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:238
#: b7ece5e282af4e9fb1937d7799070417
msgid ""
"The nose will continue to point at the red marker until the end of the "
"mission OR \"clear\" the do-set-roi and cause the vehicle to return to its "
"default behaviour (i.e. pointing at the next waypoint) by adding a second "
"DO_SET_ROI command later in the mission with all zero for Lat, Lon, and Alt."
msgstr ""
"机头将持续指向红色标记直到任务结束，或通过在任务后续中添加第二条纬度、经度、高度均为零的DO_SET_ROI指令来\"清除\"该设置，使飞行器恢复默认行为（即指向下一个航点）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:240
#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:359
#: 1be15fa8e0b04e63aedd8f07beda0355 5e0ac254b8304227ba6b71fba51a7fc3
msgid "**Lat, Lon** - the latitude and longitude targets."
msgstr "**Lat, Lon** - 目标纬度和经度。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:242
#: c13ea2cffe51471b8c3c60c11e7b207f
msgid "**Alt** - the target altitude above home in meters."
msgstr "**Alt** - 相对Home点的目标高度（米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:248
#: 4c8c31566bd0470bb069124c9246924d
msgid "Condition-Delay"
msgstr "Condition-Delay"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:253
#: 653bbad0aab340cb839442bd1be64a6d
msgid ""
"Delays the start of the next \"Do\" command for the specified number of "
"seconds. In the example above, Command #4 (Do-Set-Roi) is delayed so that it"
" only starts 5 seconds after the vehicle has passed Waypoint #2. Note: this "
"command does not stop the vehicle. Also note that the delay timer is only "
"active until the next waypoint is reached, so if the \"Do\" command hasn't "
"been triggered by then it never will be."
msgstr ""
"将下一条\"执行\"指令的启动延迟指定秒数。在上例中，指令#4（Do-Set-"
"Roi）被延迟，使其仅在飞行器通过航点#2后5秒才开始执行。注意：此指令不会停止飞行器。另请注意，延迟计时器仅在到达下一个航点之前有效，因此如果到时\"执行\"指令尚未被触发，则永远不会被触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:260
#: 59cc059c0dda446a9189cca8daeaeebc
msgid "**Time (sec)** - the time to delay the next \"Do\" command in seconds."
msgstr "**Time (sec)** - 延迟下一条\"执行\"指令的时间（秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:263
#: 375451d8d5d74fe4a3a3d294f72a1568
msgid "Condition-Distance"
msgstr "Condition-Distance"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:268
#: 58764a080e174d5c87c4e55b46e8a2fe
msgid ""
"Delays the start of the next \"Do\" command until the vehicle is within the "
"specified number of meters of the next waypoint. In the example above, "
"Command #4 (Do-Set-Roi) is delayed so that it only starts once the vehicle "
"is within 50m of waypoint #5. Note: this command does not cause the vehicle "
"to stop or pause during the mission, it only affects \"Do\" commands."
msgstr ""
"延迟下一条\"执行\"指令的启动，直到飞行器距下一个航点在指定米数以内。在上例中，指令#4（Do-Set-Roi）被延迟，使其仅在飞行器距航点#5 "
"50m以内时才开始执行。注意：此指令不会导致飞行器在任务中停止或暂停，仅影响\"执行\"指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:275
#: 3608706730c64f6baa41628926b48c1d
msgid ""
"**Dist (m)** - how close the vehicle should be to the next waypoint (in "
"meters) before beginning the next \"Do\" command."
msgstr "**Dist (m)** - 飞行器距下一个航点多近时才开始执行下一条\"执行\"指令（单位：米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:282
#: f2c7791c329e4631945c64bcfec6f159
msgid "Condition-Yaw"
msgstr "Condition-Yaw"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:287
#: 28bb8616741a4fdca1477788db755419
msgid ""
"Point the nose of the vehicle to the specified heading by a specified "
"amount."
msgstr "将飞行器机头旋转至指定航向角。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:290
#: 9aece6ea473440b49bf88a74493eacda
msgid ""
"**Deg** - the desired heading in degrees (0 = North, 90 = East, etc) when "
"\"rel/abs\" field is \"0\" (meaning absolute)"
msgstr "**Deg** - 当\"rel/abs\"字段为\"0\"（绝对）时，为期望航向角（度数，0=正北，90=正东等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:293
#: 1d62ec672d4944e88e44c38e46ec022f
msgid ""
"OR the change in heading (in degrees) when \"rel/abs\" field is \"1\" "
"(meaning relative)"
msgstr "或者当\"rel/abs\"字段为\"1\"（相对）时，为航向变化量（度数）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:296
#: d0dbcb1330584ed09a9c30f2c3cf1dad
msgid ""
"**Speed deg/s** - the rotation speed (in deg/sec) as the vehicle turns to "
"the desired heading"
msgstr "**Speed deg/s** - 飞行器转向目标航向时的旋转速度（度/秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:299
#: f39cc8737b854b18b5ab0d1e1888ef2c
msgid ""
"**Dir 1=CW** - Used to denote the direction of rotation to achieve the "
"target angle (1=CW, -1=CCW, 0= the vehicle will always turn in direction "
"that most quickly gets it to the new target heading, but only when "
"\"rel/abs\" = \"0\",)."
msgstr ""
"**Dir 1=CW** - "
"用于指定达到目标角度的旋转方向（1=顺时针，-1=逆时针，0=飞行器总是以最快方向转向新目标航向，但仅当\"rel/abs\"=\"0\"时有效）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:301
#: d6de81278e374547abadaef0d3c67629
msgid ""
"**rel/abs (0=Abs, 1=Rel)** - allows specifying the heading (i.e \"Deg\" "
"field) as an absolute heading (if \"0\") or relative to the current heading "
"(if \"1\")"
msgstr ""
"**rel/abs (0=Abs, 1=Rel)** - "
"允许将航向（即\"Deg\"字段）指定为绝对航向（若为\"0\"）或相对于当前航向的变化量（若为\"1\"）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:305
#: 3929ff079fef4fabbd7193e4073a2f22
msgid "Do-Jump"
msgstr "Do-Jump"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:310
#: 9034459004784033ba4bb5c324898c72
msgid ""
"Jump to the specified mission command the specified number of times before "
"continuing with the mission.  In the example above the vehicle would fly "
"back-and-forth between waypoints #1 and #2 a total of 3 times before flying "
"on to waypoint #4."
msgstr "在继续执行任务之前，跳转到指定的任务指令指定次数。在上例中，飞行器将在航点#1和#2之间来回飞行共3次，然后再飞向航点#4。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:315
#: c2ee603dcc19468db033604e8f7be859
msgid "**WP #** - the mission command to jump to."
msgstr "**WP #** - 要跳转到的任务指令编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:317
#: 8347efd29df840ecb0cc03b8faaddd81
msgid ""
"**Repeat** - the maximum number of times we should perform the jump. -1 "
"means always jump"
msgstr "**Repeat** - 执行跳转的最大次数，-1表示始终跳转。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:320
#: 119fde7c68574f49b09e38ca4a43c746
msgid ""
"Despite the name, Do-Jump is really a \"Nav\" command rather than a \"Do\" "
"command, so conditional commands like CONDITION_DELAY won't affect Do-Jump, "
"it will always perform the jump as soon as it hits that command."
msgstr ""
"尽管名称如此，Do-Jump实际上是\"导航\"指令而非\"执行\"指令，因此CONDITION_DELAY等条件指令不会影响Do-"
"Jump，它总是在执行到该指令时立即跳转。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:327
#: a61cb1002e65477f95426d9c44377884
msgid ""
"No more that one hundred (100) Do-Jump commands can be used in a mission. "
"This value is further reduced to fifteen (15) Do-Jump commands for boards "
"with less than 500kb of ram. Subsequent Do-Jumps will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"一个任务中最多可使用一百（100）条Do-Jump指令。对于内存小于500KB的板子，此值进一步降至十五（15）条。超出的Do-Jump指令将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:330
#: dc449dfe0ce54dcab4766982e0adfc42
msgid "Do-Aux-Function"
msgstr "Do-Aux-Function"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:335
#: 1caaf0e49fc84d488a46995075240246
msgid ""
"Allows any :ref:`auxiliary function <common-auxiliary-functions>` to be "
"executed from within a mission without setting up an auxiliary switch.  The "
"\"AuxFunction\" field should be set to the \"RCx_OPTION value\" from the "
"linked page.  The \"Switch\" fields corresponds to the auxiliary function "
"switch position with \"0\" meaning \"low\", \"1\" meaning \"middle\" and "
"\"2\" meaning high."
msgstr ""
"允许在任务中执行任何 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>` "
"而无需设置辅助开关。\"AuxFunction\"字段应设置为链接页面中的\"RCx_OPTION值\"。\"Switch\"字段对应辅助功能开关位置，\"0\"表示\"低\"，\"1\"表示\"中\"，\"2\"表示\"高\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:338
#: c14ff6407c1642b9991e177e53f832b6
msgid "Do-Change-Speed"
msgstr "Do-Change-Speed"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:343
#: 5c79cf530177450d889400169d72713c
msgid ""
"Change the desired maximum speed (in meters/sec) of the vehicle.  Normally "
"the \"Type\" field is left at 0 meaning the horizontal speed is set."
msgstr "更改飞行器的目标最大速度（单位：米/秒）。通常\"Type\"字段保留为0，表示设置水平速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:345
#: 85ba916d22a84542a9851b6833f4b0da
msgid "**Type** - 0,1:ground speed, 2:climb rate, 3:descent rate"
msgstr "**Type** - 0、1：地面速度，2：爬升速率，3：下降速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:347
#: f5a8f44b49ea4301bd482cc9f0665b4a
msgid "**Speed m/s** - the desired maximum speed in meters/second."
msgstr "**Speed m/s** - 目标最大速度（米/秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:350
#: 2efae77cc8224dba81b1dcc2bb5920e7
msgid "Do-Set-Home"
msgstr "Do-Set-Home"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:355
#: d12b60718043474c810487c8907b5e85
msgid ""
"This command should be avoided if possible and instead use :ref:`Rally "
"Points <common-rally-points>` which can also control the position used for "
"Return-To-Launch."
msgstr "应尽量避免使用此指令，改用 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>`，后者也可以控制返航所用的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:357
#: 3fb595e1c76e42ef9214dff8921895a4
msgid ""
"**Current(1)/Spec(0)** - if \"1\" use the current location as the new home, "
"if \"0\" use the specified Lat and Lon coordinate (not labelled yet!)"
msgstr "**Current(1)/Spec(0)** - 若为\"1\"则使用当前位置作为新Home点，若为\"0\"则使用指定的纬度和经度坐标（尚未标注！）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:362
#: 41f5f695ad6c4b1586386518680507b3
msgid "Do-Set-Cam-Trigg-Dist"
msgstr "Do-Set-Cam-Trigg-Dist"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:367
#: 4643ab9fc0b84ae5ba1061a5af4c9ca0
msgid ""
"Trigger the :ref:`camera shutter <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` at "
"regular distance intervals. For example the command above will cause the "
"camera shutter to trigger after every 5m that the vehicle travels."
msgstr ""
"以固定距离间隔触发 :ref:`快门 <common-camera-shutter-with-"
"servo>`。例如，上面的指令将使飞行器每行驶5m触发一次快门。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:371
#: 6716ab547cdd464fa474a2bdc1724b15
msgid "**Dist (m)** - distance interval in meters."
msgstr "**Dist (m)** - 触发距离间隔（米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:373
#: e74c59d4e3bb44edb3fbaca9e94cf3ad
msgid ""
"To stop the camera from triggering, add a DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST later in the"
" mission with Dist = 0"
msgstr "要停止触发摄像头，请在任务后续中添加Dist = 0的DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:378
#: b96fa3243b01434798341310c452128a
msgid "Do-Set-Relay"
msgstr "Do-Set-Relay"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:383
#: 68061bd3b49b437c990f54c32ef0578a
msgid "Set a :ref:`Relay <common-relay>` pin's voltage high or low."
msgstr "将 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>` 引脚电压设为高或低。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:385
#: 0dba6885f7f747c099fe6ecdcb985880
msgid "**Relay No** : 0 = First Relay, 1 = Second Relay"
msgstr "**Relay No**：0 = 第一继电器，1 = 第二继电器"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:387
#: 3a00384a027d45148eb737f6082d3c47
msgid ""
"**off(0)/On(1)** : 0 = Off (i.e. 0V), 1 = On (i.e. 3.3V on most autopilots)"
msgstr "**off(0)/On(1)**：0 = 关（即 0V），1 = 开（大多数飞控上为 3.3V）"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:391
#: 4db1ecf852e34a889d1be08bafd23f21
msgid "Do-Repeat-Relay"
msgstr "Do-Repeat-Relay"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:396
#: 46ab64e49fcd4d0ab4170603367ced1f
msgid ""
"Toggle the :ref:`Relay <common-relay>` pin's voltage a specified number of "
"times. In the example above, assuming the relay was off to begin with, it "
"would be set high and then after 3 seconds it would be toggled low again."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>` "
"引脚电压切换指定次数。在上例中，假设继电器初始为断开状态，它将被设为高电平，3秒后再切换回低电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:401
#: 1262c66799404eeb8f2257831a2adc85
msgid "**First column is Relay number** : 0 = First Relay, 1 = Second Relay"
msgstr "**第一列为继电器编号**：0 = 第一继电器，1 = 第二继电器。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:403
#: 1884da05d8914af7a7971df8bc133c52
msgid "**Repeat #** : how many times the relay should be toggled"
msgstr "**Repeat #**：继电器应切换的次数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:405
#: 369a43c288994065bf2fff9ad75bcac2
msgid "**Delay(s)** - Number of seconds between each toggle."
msgstr "**Delay(s)** - 每次切换之间的秒数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:408
#: 980bb82dd3d543e8a9eb4a817e61b0a1
msgid "Do-Set-Servo"
msgstr "Do-Set-Servo"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:413
#: 4b10d3af0b364ad6888d462ce57778c7
msgid ""
"Move a :ref:`servo <common-servo>` to a particular PWM value. In the example"
" above, the servo attached to output channel 8 would be moved to PWM 1700 "
"(servo's generally accept PWM values between 1000 and 2000)."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`舵机 <common-servo>` 移至指定PWM值。在上例中，连接到输出通道8的舵机将移至PWM "
"1700（舵机通常接受1000至2000之间的PWM值）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:417
#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:434
#: 62ce293aff5542a59a0a19df4c853ead 8893406a981042069b091e28e063b1b2
msgid "**Ser No** : the output channel the servo is attached to"
msgstr "**Ser No**：舵机连接的输出通道号。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:419
#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:436
#: 153d1984003346879ba387fef1733462 b36ad1853b7f47d38fc0a67116882344
msgid "**PWM** : PWM value to output to the servo"
msgstr "**PWM**：输出到舵机的PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:422
#: 874de53f7fef4c7aad39a43ddbd516cd
msgid "Do-Repeat-Servo"
msgstr "Do-Repeat-Servo"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:427
#: 9f04b41dc0c345dd8bf295ed02b6dea4
msgid ""
"Repeatedly move a :ref:`servo <common-servo>` back and forth between its mid"
" position and a specified PWM value. In the example above, the servo "
"attached to output channel 8 would be moved to PWM 1700, then after 4 "
"seconds, back to mid (default is 1500 which is held in the "
":ref:`RC8_TRIM<RC8_TRIM>` parameter), after another 4 seconds it would be "
"moved to 1700 again, then finally after 4 more seconds it would be moved "
"back to mid."
msgstr ""
"反复将 :ref:`舵机 <common-servo>` 在其中间位置和指定PWM值之间来回移动。在上例中，连接到输出通道8的舵机将移至PWM "
"1700，4秒后返回中间位置（默认为1500，储存在 :ref:`RC8_TRIM<RC8_TRIM>` "
"参数中），再过4秒移至1700，最后再过4秒返回中间位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:438
#: 5ec92044e6514b108226574e921ded0f
msgid ""
"**Repeat #** : Number of times to move the servo to the specified PWM value"
msgstr "**Repeat #**：将舵机移至指定PWM值的次数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:441
#: 8b9fab2832e74719983e6198d1de992c
msgid "**Delay (s)** : the delay in seconds between each servo movement"
msgstr "**Delay (s)**：每次舵机移动之间的延迟时间（秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:444
#: e21a768c0cf14cf0b3c4fc4a4bfbccb7
msgid "Do-Digicam-Control"
msgstr "Do-Digicam-Control"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:449
#: cdff990a60d24ef4a92115878509bee3
msgid ""
"Trigger the :ref:`camera shutter <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` once.  "
"The \"Shutter Cmd\" field should be set to \"1\"."
msgstr ""
"触发 :ref:`快门 <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` 一次。\"Shutter "
"Cmd\"字段应设置为\"1\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:452
#: 6fc93afc1b5a4af1b58d502458cbeb92
msgid "Do-Fence-Enable"
msgstr "Do-Fence-Enable"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:457
#: 116e04eb96c645d2bc438a2960491056
msgid ""
"Enable(1) or Disable(0) the Copter :ref:`common-ac2_simple_geofence` and/or "
"Copter :ref:`common-polygon_fence`. This command takes no additional "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
"启用(1)或禁用(0) ArduCopter的 :ref:`common-ac2_simple_geofence` 和/或 :ref:`common-"
"polygon_fence`。此指令无需额外参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:460
#: 78712cd3a9c94930a7bf2ef98d64e8ec
msgid "Do-Gimbal-Manager-PitchYaw"
msgstr "Do-Gimbal-Manager-PitchYaw"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:465
#: 2564ee9829354cab9f35e878c49c2795
msgid ""
"Moves the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` to the desired "
"pitch and yaw angles (in degrees).  Positive pitch angles are up, Negative "
"are down.  Positive yaw angles are clockwise, negative are counter "
"clockwise.   If the \"Flags\" field is \"0\" the yaw angle is in \"body "
"frame\" (e.g. 0 is forward).  If \"Flags\" is \"16\" the yaw angle is in "
"\"earth frame\" (e.g. 0 is North)."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`摄像头云台 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` "
"移至期望的俯仰和偏航角度（单位：度）。正俯仰角为向上，负值为向下。正偏航角为顺时针，负值为逆时针。若\"Flags\"字段为\"0\"，偏航角为\"机体坐标系\"（例如0为正前方）；若\"Flags\"为\"16\"，偏航角为\"地理坐标系\"（例如0为正北）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:467
#: 9c412163618e459fb8afeea0cb7f26ed
msgid ""
"Alternatively Pitch Rate and Yaw Rate fields can be used to move the gimbal "
"at a specified rate in deg/sec.  A Condition-Delay for a few seconds "
"followed by another Do-Gimbal-Manager-PitchYaw should be used to eventually "
"stop the gimbal from rotating."
msgstr ""
"或者可以使用俯仰速率和偏航速率字段，以指定的速率（度/秒）移动云台。应使用Condition-Delay延迟几秒后再添加一条Do-Gimbal-"
"Manager-PitchYaw指令来最终停止云台旋转。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:470
#: 0a65b174c65e4c7eae11356aeb175acf
msgid "Do-Mount-Control"
msgstr "Do-Mount-Control"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:475
#: a1a5f3145298464da439258b982ae3d2
msgid ""
"Controls the roll, pitch and yaw angle of the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-"
"cameras-and-gimbals>`. This can be used to point the camera in specific "
"directions at various times in the mission."
msgstr ""
"控制 :ref:`摄像头云台 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` "
"的横滚、俯仰和偏航角度。可用于在任务的不同时间将摄像头指向特定方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:478
#: c445d17d6c17448bbfa0eec809796530
msgid "Do-Gripper"
msgstr "Do-Gripper"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:483
#: 8ef16b1f79384086a4a7884fc34ce578
msgid ""
"This command allows opening and closing a :ref:`servo gripper <common-"
"gripper-servo>` or :ref:`EPM gripper <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`. Set the "
"\"drop/grab\" column to 0 to close the gripper, 1 to open the gripper.  The "
"first column, \"Gripper No\" is ignored because we currently only support a "
"single gripper per vehicle."
msgstr ""
"此指令允许打开和关闭 :ref:`舵机夹持器 <common-gripper-servo>` 或 :ref:`EPM夹持器 <common-"
"cameras-and-gimbals>`。将\"drop/grab\"列设为0以关闭夹持器，设为1以打开夹持器。第一列\"Gripper "
"No\"被忽略，因为目前每辆飞行器只支持一个夹持器。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:487
#: 5aa4e494ae89417aa878e6c81f6d5b13
msgid "Do-Winch"
msgstr "Do-Winch"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:492
#: 1d62c4bc09e549838936245220a2c59d
msgid ""
"This command allows controlling a :ref:`winch <common-daiwa-winch>` to raise"
" or lower a package."
msgstr "此指令允许控制 :ref:`绞盘 <common-daiwa-winch>` 来升降货物。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:494
#: a78801b4c07443d7a4678ac84152d265
msgid "\"winch no\" is not used"
msgstr ""
"winch no\"不使用。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3495, \"zh\": \"\"action\"应设为0以松开绞盘，1为长度控制，2为速率控制。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3496, \"zh\": \"\"length\"应填写要释放的线缆长度（米）。正数释放线缆，负数收回线缆。注意\"action\"应设为\"1\"。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3497, \"zh\": \"\"rate\"应填写释放线缆的速度（米/秒）。正数释放线缆，负数收回线缆。注意\"action\"应设为\"2\"。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3498, \"zh\": \"电机推力缩放\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3499, \"zh\": \"ArduCopter包含*电机推力缩放*功能，用于补偿大多数ESC和电机的非线性推力输出。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3500, \"zh\": \"默认曲线适用于几乎所有ESC/电机组合。通常无需调整参数，除非已测量了飞行器的实际推力曲线。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3501, \"zh\": \"推力曲线\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3502, \"zh\": \"该曲线由两个参数控制：\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3503, \"zh\": \":ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO<MOT_THST_EXPO>` 控制推力曲线的形状，\"0\"表示完全线性曲线，\"1.0\"表示非常弯曲（见下图）。默认值为\"0.65\"（下图中错误地标注默认值为0.5）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3504, \"zh\": \"某些ESC内置了线性化曲线，默认EXPO值\"0.65\"会导致稳定性问题，需要通过推力台测量来调整EXPO值。通常结果值为\"0\"至\"0.2\"。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3505, \"zh\": \":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MAX<MOT_SPIN_MAX>` 控制推力在接近最大值时趋于平坦的点。默认值为0.95，表示满油门的95%。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3506, \"zh\": \"推力台\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3507, \"zh\": \"以下推力台可用于测量特定电机、ESC和电池组合的PWM信号与推力输出关系。测量时请确保使用ESC额定输入PWM范围。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3508, \"zh\": \"`RCbenchmark.com推力台 <https://www.rcbenchmark.com/pages/series-1580-thrust-stand-dynamometer>`__\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3509, \"zh\": \"`Turnigy推力台 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-thrust-stand-and-power-analyser-v3.html>`__\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3510, \"zh\": \"参数计算\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3511, \"zh\": \"可使用 `此电子表格 <https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1_75aZqiT_K1CdduhUe4-DjRgx3Alun4p8V2pt6vM5P8/edit#gid=0>`__ 的副本，根据上述推力台数据计算适当的参数值。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3512, \"zh\": \"Parrot Bebop飞控\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3513, \"zh\": \"Parrot `Bebop2 <https://www.parrot.com/global/drones/parrot-bebop-2-fpv>`__ 是一款通过Wifi控制的四轴无人机，使用可运行ArduPilot固件的Linux飞控。将Bebop转换为运行ArduPilot的说明在 :ref:`这里 <dev:building-for-bebop-2>`。我们推荐Bebop2而非原版Bebop，因其GPS大幅改进。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3514, \"zh\": \"ArduCopter支持在Copter-3.3版本中加入。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3515, \"zh\": \"规格参数\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3516, \"zh\": \"**处理器**\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3517, \"zh\": \"Parrot P7双核CPU Cortex 9，配四核GPU\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3518, \"zh\": \"8GB闪存\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3519, \"zh\": \"**传感器**\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3520, \"zh\": \"MPU6050加速度计和陀螺仪（I2C）\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3521, \"zh\": \"AKM 8963罗盘\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3522, \"zh\": \"MS5607气压计\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3523, \"zh\": \"`Furuno GN-87F GPS <https://www.furuno.com/en/products/gnss-module/GN-87>`__\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3524, \"zh\": \"声呐\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3525, \"zh\": \"光流\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3526, \"zh\": \"高清摄像头\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3527, \"zh\": \"**接口**\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3528, \"zh\": \"1个UART串行端口\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3529, \"zh\": \"USB\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3530, \"zh\": \"内置Wifi\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3531, \"zh\": \"**尺寸**\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3532, \"zh\": \"33x38x3.6cm（含外壳）\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3533, \"zh\": \"400g（含外壳）\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3534, \"zh\": \"**操作系统**\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3535, \"zh\": \"Linux（Busybox）\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3536, \"zh\": \"部分信息来自 `Paparazzi UAV wiki关于Bebop的页面 <http://wiki.paparazziuav.org/wiki/Bebop>`__。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3537, \"zh\": \"Bebop运行Copter-3.3的视频\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3538, \"zh\": \"固件上传流程\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3539, \"zh\": \"存档：PDF指南\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3540, \"zh\": \"以下链接提供可打印并用作指南和清单的PDF文件下载。内容涵盖在多旋翼中安装和使用APM2或PX4。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3541, \"zh\": \"非常感谢您对这些可打印指南的任何反馈。请在本页底部链接的APM论坛上报告任何错误、遗漏以及您对其他主题的想法。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3542, \"zh\": \"`APM2_Quad_Setup_3 <https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_Quad_Setup_3.pdf>`__ - 四轴飞行器中APM2安装与设置指南。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3543, \"zh\": \"`APM2_Flamewheel_Quad_Setup1 <https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_Flamewheel_Quad_Setup1.pdf>`__ - DJI Flamewheel F450四轴飞行器与APM2配合使用的补充指南。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3544, \"zh\": \"`APM2_Quad_Stabilize_1 <https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_Quad_Stabilize_1.pdf>`__ - 在Stabilize模式下飞行四轴飞行器及初始PID调整指南。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3545, \"zh\": \"`APM2_Quad_AltHold_Loiter_1 <https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_Quad_AltHold_Loiter_1.pdf>`__ - 在定高、Loiter和位置模式下飞行四轴飞行器及初始PID调整指南。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3546, \"zh\": \"`APM2_PID_MAP_4 <https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_PID_MAP_4.pdf>`__ - 2012年9月1日ArduCopter 2.7.2版本Mission Planner中PID、配置和参数列表的PID分配表。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3547, \"zh\": \"PosHold模式\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3548, \"zh\": \"PosHold飞行模式与 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 类似，当遥控器摇杆居中时，飞行器保持恒定位置、航向和高度。主要区别在于飞手的横滚和俯仰输入直接控制飞行器的倾斜角。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3549, \"zh\": \"一般情况下，推荐使用 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 而非PosHold。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3550, \"zh\": \"概述\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3551, \"zh\": \"开启时，PosHold模式将自动尝试保持当前位置、航向和高度。良好的GPS定位、:ref:`低罗盘磁干扰 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs_compass_interference>`\\\\ 以及 :ref:`低震动 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs_vibrations>` 对于实现良好的悬停性能都非常重要。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3552, \"zh\": \"操控\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3553, \"zh\": \"飞手可以通过控制摇杆水平和垂直调整飞行器位置。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3554, \"zh\": \"水平位置可通过横滚和俯仰控制摇杆调整，默认最大倾斜角为45度（倾斜角可通过 :ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>` 参数调整）。当飞手松开摇杆后飞机将向后倾斜使飞行器停止。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3555, \"zh\": \"高度可通过油门控制摇杆进行控制，与 :ref:`AltHold模式 <altholdmode_controls>` 相同。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3556, \"zh\": \"航向可通过偏航控制摇杆设定。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3557, \"zh\": \"可以在PosHold模式下解锁，但需要GPS已获得三维锁定且HDOP已降至2.0或以下。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3558, \"zh\": \"在Pixhawk上，LED将变为绿色（:ref:`更多LED指示灯模式详情 <common-apm-board-leds>`）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3559, \"zh\": \"可以通过在Mission Planner快速屏幕上双击然后从大型复选框网格中选择\"gpshdop\"，使HDOP值清晰可见。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3560, \"zh\": \"最大制动角可通过 :ref:`PHLD_BRAKE_ANGLE<PHLD_BRAKE_ANGLE>` 参数设置（例如3000 = 飞行器最大向后倾斜30度）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3561, \"zh\": \"飞行器回到最大角度的速度可通过 :ref:`PHLD_BRAKE_RATE<PHLD_BRAKE_RATE>` 参数设置（例如8 = 以每秒8度的速度回转）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3562, \"zh\": \"IR-LOCK传感器和信标\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3563, \"zh\": \"Landmark精准降落系统\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3564, \"zh\": \"精准降落与精准悬停\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3565, \"zh\": \"ArduCopter支持 **精准降落** 和 **精准悬停**，使用外部位置参考（即\"降落目标\"），在降落或在目标上方悬停时实现厘米级精度。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3566, \"zh\": \"精准降落可通过伴侣计算机发送的MAVLink `LANDING_TARGET <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ 消息（如 `Landmark系统 <https://landmarklanding.com/products/landmark-precision-landing-system>`__）来实现，也可使用 `IR-LOCK传感器 <https://irlock.com/products/ir-lock-sensor-precision-landing-kit>`__、`信标 <https://irlock.com/products/markone-beacon-v3-0-beta>`__ 和 :ref:`测距仪 <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` 来实现。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3567, \"zh\": \"当飞行器进入 :ref:`Land模式 <land-mode>` 且检测到降落目标时，目标位置将用于引导最终下降。精准降落也可在 :ref:`RTL模式 <rtl-mode>` 中作为返航序列的最终阶段执行。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3568, \"zh\": \"精准悬停无需额外设置，通过进入 :ref:`Loiter模式 <loiter-mode>` 并调用精准悬停 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 即可激活。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3569, \"zh\": \"*此视频演示了使用Landmark精准降落系统进行精准悬停后接精准降落的过程。*\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3570, \"zh\": \"可用系统\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3571, \"zh\": \"快速入门\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3572, \"zh\": \"将 :ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>` 设置为 **1** 并重启以开放参数。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3573, \"zh\": \"通过 :ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>` 选择降落目标位置源（例如：**1** = MAVLink `LANDING_TARGET <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__，**2** = IR-LOCK，**3** = Gazebo仿真，**4** = SITL；**0** 为禁用）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3574, \"zh\": \"如果降落目标摄像头/传感器未朝下或X轴未朝前，请使用 :ref:`PLND_ORIENT <PLND_ORIENT>` 和 :ref:`PLND_YAW_ALIGN <PLND_YAW_ALIGN>` 配置安装方向。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3575, \"zh\": \"在未解锁状态下验证目标是否被检测到，并确认移动目标/飞行器时报告的偏移量会发生变化。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3576, \"zh\": \"起飞并在目标上方悬停。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3577, \"zh\": \"（建议）在尝试精准降落之前，先在精准悬停中确认稳定跟踪。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3578, \"zh\": \"激活 :ref:`Land模式 <land-mode>` 以启动精准降落。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3579, \"zh\": \"精准降落需要有效的水平位置估计和稳定的姿态解算。GPS/EKF质量差或测距仪噪声大将降低性能。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3580, \"zh\": \"操作\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3581, \"zh\": \"在启用精准降落并激活Land模式后，外部降落目标测量值将在最终进近时覆盖GPS解算提供的目标位置。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3582, \"zh\": \"如果未找到降落目标，飞行器将继续垂直下降，直至 :ref:`PLND_ALT_MAX <PLND_ALT_MAX>` 指定的高度。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3583, \"zh\": \"如果降落目标丢失，行为取决于 :ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>`：\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3584, \"zh\": \"**0** – 继续使用标准Land模式逻辑降落（非严格模式）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3585, \"zh\": \"**1** – 执行降落重试，直到达到 :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` 次，然后正常降落。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3586, \"zh\": \"**2** – 执行降落重试，直到达到 :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` 次，然后悬停而非降落。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3587, \"zh\": \"当触发降落重试时，飞行器将爬升至由 :ref:`PLND_RET_BEHAVE <PLND_RET_BEHAVE>` 确定的高度/位置，然后再次下降以期检测到降落目标。它将持续执行此操作直到达到 :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` 次重试。然后，根据 :ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>`，飞行器将直接降落或留在空中悬停（适用于例如在船上降落且不希望降落到水面的情况）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3588, \"zh\": \"如果在 :ref:`PLND_ALT_MIN <PLND_ALT_MIN>` 指定的高度以下丢失降落目标，飞行器将继续垂直降落。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3589, \"zh\": \"ArduPilot的EKF假设降落目标是静止的。若降落在移动目标上，请设置 :ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` 的第0位。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3590, \"zh\": \"除非设置了 :ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` 的第1位（允许手动重定位后继续精准降落），否则飞手在降落过程中手动重定位将中止降落。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3591, \"zh\": \"最终降落速度可能低于 :ref:`LAND_SPEED <LAND_SPEED>`，以确保精准触地。可通过设置 :ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` 的第2位来禁用此功能以获得更快的最终降落速度。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3592, \"zh\": \"*此视频演示了不同PLND_STRICT设置下的行为。*\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3593, \"zh\": \"参数\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3594, \"zh\": \":ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>`：设置为1以启用精准降落。刷新参数以查看以下内容：\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3595, \"zh\": \":ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>`：设置降落目标位置源的类型。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3596, \"zh\": \":ref:`PLND_ORIENT <PLND_ORIENT>` / :ref:`PLND_YAW_ALIGN <PLND_YAW_ALIGN>`：设置降落目标摄像头/传感器的安装方向。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3597, \"zh\": \":ref:`PLND_LAND_OFS_X <PLND_LAND_OFS_X>` / :ref:`PLND_LAND_OFS_Y <PLND_LAND_OFS_Y>`：设置摄像头/传感器相对于目标的期望降落位置。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`common-sensor-offset-compensation` 页面。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3598, \"zh\": \":ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_X <PLND_CAM_POS_X>` / :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Y <PLND_CAM_POS_Y>` / :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Z <PLND_CAM_POS_Z>`：设置摄像头/传感器相对于飞行器机体坐标系的位置。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3599, \"zh\": \":ref:`PLND_XY_DIST_MAX <PLND_XY_DIST_MAX>`：即使检测到降落目标，如果距离超过此距离（米），飞行器也不会开始下降。设为0则始终下降。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3600, \"zh\": \":ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>`：控制目标丢失时的降落行为。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3601, \"zh\": \":ref:`PLND_ALT_MIN <PLND_ALT_MIN>`：如果目标在此高度以下丢失，飞行器将继续垂直下降。设为0以禁用此功能。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3602, \"zh\": \":ref:`PLND_ALT_MAX <PLND_ALT_MAX>`：如果未检测到目标，飞行器将继续垂直下降直至此高度。在此高度以下，如果仍未找到目标，将应用 :ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>` 设置的降落重试逻辑。设为0以禁用此功能。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3603, \"zh\": \":ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>`：若降落目标在移动则设置第0位，若允许手动重定位后继续精准降落则设置第1位，若启用更快的最终下降则设置第2位。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3604, \"zh\": \"更多 ``PLND_`` 参数列于 `完整参数列表 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#plnd-parameters>`__。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3605, \"zh\": \"精准悬停\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3606, \"zh\": \"精准悬停使用与精准降落相同的后端和参数。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3607, \"zh\": \"要启用精准悬停，请将 :ref:`辅助功能开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 设置为39（精准悬停启用）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3608, \"zh\": \"进入Loiter模式并激活该开关，将使飞行器保持在目标上方位置。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3609, \"zh\": \"基于MAVLink LANDING_TARGET消息的系统\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3610, \"zh\": \"使用伴侣计算机、摄像头和基准标记系统（如 `AprilTag <https://docs.wpilib.org/en/stable/docs/software/vision-processing/apriltag/apriltag-intro.html>`__），可以通过MAVLink `LANDING_TARGET <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ 消息将与降落目标的位置差发送给飞控。以下是一个示例系统描述：`使用Realsense T265摄像头和AprilTag进行精准降落 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/precision-landing-with-realsense-t265-camera-and-apriltag-part-1-2/48978>`__。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3611, \"zh\": \"IR-LOCK传感器\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3612, \"zh\": \"MarkOne信标V3.0\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3613, \"zh\": \"MarkOne信标V2.0\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3614, \"zh\": \"信标V1.1\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3615, \"zh\": \"IR-LOCK精准降落系统\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3616, \"zh\": \"*精准降落演示。*\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3617, \"zh\": \"*精准悬停演示。*\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3618, \"zh\": \"概述\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3619, \"zh\": \"IR-LOCK传感器是 `Pixy摄像头 <https://pixycam.com/pixy-cmucam5/>`__ 的改进版，已预先配置为红外信标探测器。有多种与该传感器兼容的红外信标。`MarkOne信标V3.0 <https://irlock.com/products/markone-beacon-v3-0-beta>`__ 可在 **所有光线条件** 下可靠检测，探测距离达 **15米**。`信标V1.1 <https://irlock.com/products/beacon>`__ 是一种更具成本效益的选项，可在 **大多数光线条件** 下可靠检测。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3620, \"zh\": \"购买渠道\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3621, \"zh\": \"IR-LOCK传感器和信标可从 `irlock.com <https://irlock.com/>`__ 购买。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3622, \"zh\": \"IR-LOCK传感器和红外信标\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3623, \"zh\": \"连接到飞控\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3624, \"zh\": \"IR-LOCK传感器可通过 `I2C线缆 <https://irlock.com/collections/shop/products/pixhawk-cable>`__ 直接连接到飞控。如果您使用多个I2C传感器，则需要一个\\\\ `I2C分路器 <https://store.mrobotics.io/mRo-DF13-I2C-Bus-Splitter-for-Pixhawk-p/mro-df13-i2c-split-5-mr.htm>`__。更详细的说明包含在 `IR-LOCK文档 <https://irlock.readme.io/docs>`__ 中。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3625, \"zh\": \"如有需要，还提供其他 ``PLND_`` 参数用于调整飞行器上降落探测器的位置。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3626, \"zh\": \"IR-LOCK传感器/飞控接线\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3627, \"zh\": \"安装到机架\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3628, \"zh\": \"IR-LOCK传感器应安装在机架底部，摄像头镜头直接朝下对准地面。IRIS的安装支架在 `此处 <https://irlock.com/collections/frontpage/products/sensor-bracket-for-iris>`__ 有售（见下图）。传感器板的方向应使板上的白色按钮朝向飞行器前方（换句话说，最靠近摄像头镜头的一侧应朝向飞行器前方）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3629, \"zh\": \"下图显示了安装在3DR IRIS+ *底部*的摄像头。最好将传感器尽可能靠近飞控安装，但在各种安装位置上的测试也都取得了成功。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3630, \"zh\": \"IR-LOCK传感器安装在Iris+底部\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3631, \"zh\": \"*IR-LOCK传感器安装示意。*\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3632, \"zh\": \"通过Mission Planner进行设置\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3633, \"zh\": \"通过Mission Planner（或其他地面站）设置以下参数以启用精准降落功能，然后重启飞控。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3634, \"zh\": \":ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>` = 1\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3635, \"zh\": \":ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>` = 2\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3636, \"zh\": \"要启用精准悬停，必须将 :ref:`辅助功能开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 设置为39（精准悬停启用）。在Copter-4.0之前的版本中，可通过Mission Planner将CHx_OPT参数设置为39来启用。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3637, \"zh\": \"飞行与测试\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3638, \"zh\": \"将飞行器的其中一个飞行模式设置为Land（截至本wiki页面撰写时，精准降落功能仅在Land模式下运行）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3639, \"zh\": \"将红外信标放置在地面上，在目标上方约10m处起飞。将飞行器切换到Land模式。如果一切正常，飞机应朝红外信标移动。以下是一个成功演示（使用旧版固件）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3640, \"zh\": \"请做好随时接管控制的准备，以防出现突发意外移动（切换模式至Stabilize、AltHold或Loiter）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 3641, \"zh\": \"如果飞行器行为异常，请下载dataflash日志并检查PL消息。\"}"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:495
#: fdf0f8a68cdc4d1f848de2f6e6fa7d51
msgid ""
"\"action\" should be 0 to relax the winch, 1 for Length control, 2 for Rate "
"control"
msgstr "「action」应设置为 0 表示放松绞车，1 表示长度控制，2 表示速率控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:496
#: 615d00ea43254e1e83be1d7890964363
msgid ""
"\"length\" should be filled in with the meters of line to release.  Positive"
" numbers release the line, negative retract the line.  Note \"action\" "
"should be \"1\"."
msgstr "「length」应填写要放出的线缆长度（单位：米）。正数放出线缆，负数收回线缆。注意「action」应设置为「1」。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-command-list.rst:497
#: 743e477e87074a4e9ba0e3ad1c81b9d0
msgid ""
"\"rate\" should be filled in with the speed (in m/s) to release the line.  "
"Positive numbers release the line, negative retract the line.  Note "
"\"action\" should be \"2\"."
msgstr "「rate」应填写放出线缆的速度（单位：米/秒）。正数放出线缆，负数收回线缆。注意「action」应设置为「2」。"
